flowchart TD
  accTitle: Database failover procedure
  accDescr {
    Primary promotes the replica when the health check fails twice in a
    row, then the load balancer is repointed and the old primary is
    fenced.
  }
  P[Primary] --> H{Health check}
  H -->|fails twice| PR[Promote replica]
  PR --> LB[Repoint load balancer]
  LB --> F[Fence old primary]
